# Parameter file for `split-pipe --mode mkref`
# The synthetic genome is 300000 bp long. STAR's suffix-array index needs
# genomeSAindexNbases <= log2(300000) / 2 - 1 = 8.10, hence 8.
# STAR options go through the single `mkref_star_args` parameter as a
# comma-separated list: split-pipe lowercases parfile keys, so the camelCase
# `mkref_star_genomeSAindexNbases` of Parse's shipped example is not recognized.
mkref_star_args  --genomeSAindexNbases,8,--genomeSAsparseD,2,--limitGenomeGenerateRAM,4000000000
